2 Ge', '{"Sản phẩm":"Bo mạch chủ","Tên Hãng":"ASROCK&nbsp;","Model":"A520M-HVS","CPU hỗ trợ":"AMD","Chipset":"A520","Khe cắm mở rộng":"- 1 x PCI Express 3.0 x16 Slot (PCIE2: x16 mode)* - 1 x PCI Express 3.0 x1 Slot","LAN / Wireless":"- PCIE x1 Gigabit LAN 10/100/1000 Mb/s - Realtek RTL8111H - Supports Wake-On-LAN - Supports Lightning/ESD Protection - Supports Energy Efficient Ethernet 802.3az - Supports PXE","Kích cỡ":"Micro ATX Form Factor: 9.0-in x 7.9-in, 23.0 cm x 20.1 cm"}', 0, 1);
