 H610M-H2/M.2 &nbsp;là một trong nhữ', '{"Sản phẩm":"Bo mạch chủ","Tên Hãng":"Asrock&nbsp;","CPU hỗ trợ":"Intel","Chipset":"H610","Khe cắm mở rộng":"CPU: - 1 x PCIe 4.0 x16 Slot (PCIE1), supports x16 mode* Chipset: - 1 x PCIe 3.0 x1 Slot (PCIE2)","Ổ cứng hỗ trợ":"Chipset: - 1 x Ultra M.2 Socket (M2_1, Key M), supports type 2242/2260/2280 PCIe Gen3x4 (32 Gb/s) mode* - 4 x SATA3 6.0 Gb/s Connectors","Cổng kết nối (Back Panel)":"- 1 x PS/2 Mouse/Keyboard Port - 2 x HDMI Ports - 2 x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type-A Ports - 4 x USB 2.0 Ports - 1 x RJ-45 LAN Port - HD Audio Jacks: Line in / Front Speaker / Microphone","LAN / Wireless":"- Gigabit LAN 10/100/1000 Mb/s - Realtek 8111H","Kích cỡ":"- Micro ATX Form Factor: 8.66-in x 7.6-in, 22.0 cm x 19.3 cm"}', 0, 1);
