)* - 2 x Chassis Fan Connectors (4-pin) (Smart Fan Speed Control)** - 1 x 24 pin ATX Power Connector - 1 x 4 pin 12V Power Connector - 1 x Front Panel Audio Connector -', '{"Sản phẩm":"Bo mạch chủ","Tên Hãng":"ASROCK&nbsp;","Model":"A520M/ac","CPU hỗ trợ":"AMD","Chipset":"A520","Khe cắm mở rộng":"- 1 x PCI Express 3.0 x16 Slot (PCIE2: x16 mode)* - 1 x PCI Express 3.0 x1 Slot - 1 x Vertical M.2 Socket (Key E) with the bundled WiFi-802.11ac module (on the rear I/O)","LAN&nbsp;":"- PCIE x1 Gigabit LAN 10/100/1000 Mb/s","Kích cỡ":"Mini-ITX Form Factor: 6.7-in x 6.7-in, 17.0 cm x 17.0 cm"}', 0, 1);
