acity of system memory: 128GB * ', '{"Sản phẩm":"Mainboard - Bo mạch chủ","Tên Hãng":"Asrock","Model":"B550M Pro4","Hỗ trợ CPU (Bộ vi xử lý)":"- Supports 3 rd &nbsp; Gen AMD AM4 Ryzen™ / future AMD Ryzen™ Processors * - Digi Power design - 8 Power Phase design &nbsp; * Not compatible with AMD Ryzen™ 5 3400G and Ryzen™ 3 3200G.","Chipset":"- AMD B550","LAN":"- PCIE x1 Gigabit LAN 10/100/1000 Mb/s - Realtek RTL8111H - Supports Wake-On-LAN - Supports Lightning/ESD Protection - Supports Energy Efficient Ethernet 802.3az - Supports PXE","Phụ kiện":"- Quick Installation Guide, Support CD, I/O Shield - 2 x SATA Data Cables - 2 x Screws for M.2 Sockets","Kích cỡ":"- Micro ATX Form Factor: 9.6-in x 9.6-in, 24.4 cm x 24.4 cm - Solid Capacitor design - 2oz Copper PCB","Chứng nhận":"- FCC, CE - ErP/EuP ready (ErP/EuP ready power supply is required)"}', 0, 1);
