ltek 2.5Gb Ethernet port ', '{"Sản phẩm":"Bo mạch chủ","Tên Hãng":"Asus","Model":"EX-B760M-V5 DDR4","CPU hỗ trợ":"Intel","Chipset":"B760","Khe cắm mở rộng":"Intel ® &nbsp;13 th &nbsp;&amp; 12 th &nbsp;Gen Processors 1 x PCIe 4.0 x16 slot Intel ® &nbsp;B760 Chipset 2 x PCIe 4.0 x1 slots","Cổng kết nối (Back Panel)":"4 x USB 3.2 Gen 1 ports (4 x Type-A) 2 x USB 2.0 ports (2 x Type-A) 1 x VGA port 1 x HDMI ® &nbsp;port 3 x Audio jacks 1 x Realtek 2.5Gb Ethernet port 1 x PS/2 Keyboard/Mouse combo port","LAN / Wireless":"1 x Realtek 2.5Gb Ethernet","Kích cỡ":"mATX Form Factor 9.6 inch x 8.3 inch(24.4cm x 21.1cm)"}', 0, 1);
