ilt(angle):&nbsp; -5∘~+21∘ Swivel(angle):&nbsp; -20∘~+20∘ Pivot(angle/direction):&nbsp; +90∘ Height Adjustment (mm):&nbsp; 130mm VESA Wall Mounting(mm):&nbsp; 100*100mm Kensington lock:&nbsp; Yes Phys. Dime', '{"LCD":"IPS","2560 x 1440":"144Hz","16:9":"1000 :1","1.07 Billion":"350 cd/m2","1ms MPRT":"DisplayPort,&nbsp;HDMI,&nbsp;USB","Free Sync":"100mm x 100mm","Gigabyte":"27\'\'"}', 0, 1);
