t WEP, WPA/WAP2/WPA3, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, 802.1x Modulation Technology DBPSK, DQPSK, CCK, OFDM, 16-QAM, 64-QAM, 256-QAM, 1024QAM Chứng chỉ CE, FCC, RoHS Sản phẩm bao gồm Archer TX55E Two High-Gain Antennas Low-Profile Bracket Standard Bluetooth Header Cable Quick Installa', '{"Hãng sản xuất":"TP-LINK","Model":"TX55E","Tên sản phẩm&nbsp;":"Card mạng TP-LINK ARCHER TX55E","Dimensions":"2.4 x 1.4 x 0.45 in (55 x 36 x 11.5 mm)","Dạng Ăng ten":"Two High-Gain Dual Band Antennas","Chipset":"Intel Wi-Fi 6 Chipset","Standards and Protocols":"Bluetooth 5.2, Bluetooth 5.0, Bluetooth 4.2, Bluetooth 4.0","Interface":"F_USB 2.0","Chuẩn Wi-Fi":"IEEE 802.11ax/ac/n/a 5 GHz IEEE 802.11ax/n/g/b 2.4 GHz Bluetooth 5.2/5.0/4.2/4.0","WLAN Transmit Power":"5 GHz : 27dBm(FCC) / 23dBm(CE) (EIRP) 2.4 GHz : 26dBm(FCC) / 20dBm(CE) (EIRP)","WLAN Modes":"WLAN Modes","Bảo mật Wi-Fi":"Support 64/128 bit WEP, WPA/WAP2/WPA3, WPA-PSK/WPA2-PSK, 802.1x"}', 0, 1);
