m Illuminator IR LEDs 4 IR Distance Up to 20m Wavelength 850nm White LEDs 1 Whitelight Distance 10m Compression Standard Video Compression S+265/H.265/H.264B/H.264M/H.264H Video Bit Rate 32k~4Mbps Audio Compression&nbsp; G', '{"Camera":"Image Sensor","Min. Illumination":"Color: 0.02Lux@(F1.6,AGC ON), B/W: 0Lux with IR","Shutter Time":"1s~1/100000s","Day&amp;Night":"IR-cut filter with auto switch (ICR)","Smart IR":"Yes","WDR":"DWDR","S/N":"&gt;40dB","Angle Adjustment":"0~350°(P); -25~90°(T)&nbsp;","Lens":"Lens Type","Focal Length&nbsp;":"4mm","Lens Mount":"M12","Aperture Range":"F1.6"}', 0, 1);
